OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAInspectors upgrade rating for
OL,4,Amaternity services
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut inspectors were critical of
OL,7,Fmaternity services at Queen's Hospital
OL,8,FBurton - part of the same hospital
OL,9,Ftrust - and said they observed one
OL,10,Fwoman waiting for 10 hours to see a
OL,11,Fdoctor and records of other women who
OL,12,Fhad self-discharged while awaiting
OL,13,Fassessment.
OL,15,FUniversity Hospitals of Derby and
OL,16,FBurton (UHDB) welcomed the inspection
OL,17,Fbut said it accepted there was "still
OL,18,Fmore work to do".
